<figure id="A4.F7.sf7" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.02480v1/x9.svg" id="A4.F7.sf7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:132/133;" width="132" height="133"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(g) </span>TweetEval-Hate</figcaption>
