<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Class-Conditional Risk Control</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide all results from our experiments investigating the class-conditional risk levels over all datasets and models using a 50-50 split of correct and incorrect demonstrations. Results are shown in Figures <a href="#A8.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ Appendix H Class-Conditional Risk Control ‣ Safe and Efficient In-Context Learning via Risk Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a> and <a href="#A8.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Appendix H Class-Conditional Risk Control ‣ Safe and Efficient In-Context Learning via Risk Control" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>.</p>
</div>
